ronized booty bouncing to gravity-defying farting, every move is meticulously judged by a panel of esteemed cheek connoisseurs.<br><br>Play as your favorite Buttopian in this physics-based 2D Platformer Party Game with your friends and claim all the glory. Always remember, Champion Buttopians always come dressed to kill.<br><br><br>- Play Solo to collect as many coins and buy character skins<br>- Play against friends in different game modes to really show them who's who<br>- Fart Fire (Pretty cool, we know)<br>- Dress your Buttopian up to show up and show off!<br>- Most Importantly, <strong>HAVE FUN!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229230/extras/d1eb2acbd84634b963a2bda926e03d10.avif?t=1723711806\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229230/extras/da2155987760f960655f594450f953fb.avif?t=1723711806\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls XBOX</h2><br>A - Fart<br>B - SuperFart<br>RT - Grapple<br>LT - Steal Key From Player<br>L Analog - Movement<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Keyboard</h2><br>WASD - Movement <br>R Shift - Grapple  <br>Space Bar - Fart<br>Next level -  Space Bar",
